WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
To head left, turn right first and follow the signs to the U-turn.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
Follow the STOP or YIELD sign. Check traffic and enter when it is safe.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
Signal, check your mirrors and blind spot, and change lanes when it is safe.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
Follow the sign and wait for enough room to complete your turn safely.

00:24.000 --> 00:30.100
You are now heading in the opposite direction. Continue toward your destination.
